Feature: Strict scenario structure
  Scenario: complete scenario structure
    Given an established setup phase
    And another setup step
    When an action is performed
    But another action is also performed
    Then the result is verified

  Scenario: scenario without an effective Given phase
    And an orphaned secondary setup step
    When an action is performed without setup
    Then the result is still verified

  Scenario: scenario without an effective When phase
    Given an established setup without an action
    And another setup-only step
    Then the setup result is verified

  Scenario Outline: outline without an effective Then phase
    Given an established outline setup for "<state>"
    When an outline action is performed
    But another outline action is performed

    Examples:
      | state  |
      | active |
